WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.149 --> 00:00:07.390
Our government closed the cities and then we realized that this was really, really dangerous.

00:00:07.390 --> 00:00:10.410
It definitely feels like a movie.

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:11.490
The streets are empty.

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:13.700
And all of the stores are empty.

00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:17.500
The situation is very dramatic.

00:00:17.510 --> 00:00:21.650
Your brain starts to function in another way to survive.

00:00:21.650 --> 00:00:24.869
So it's very difficult because we are not free.

00:00:24.869 --> 00:00:26.840
But we are together.

00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:32.100
All over the globe there are people doing things from their balconies and windows.

00:00:32.119 --> 00:00:34.980
When I saw this I thought, we should do that as well.

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:39.210
Music has the power to change a bad day.

00:00:44.580 --> 00:00:48.940
I am not a doctor, I cannot heal people, but I can give hope.

00:00:48.940 --> 00:00:55.140
And I can make people fly with me in a perfect world at least for five minutes a day.

00:01:01.140 --> 00:01:05.300
I think that people are using art to express their deepest senses of joy.

00:01:07.880 --> 00:01:09.780
Welcome to kitchen quarantine.

00:01:09.780 --> 00:01:12.580
It's just at the end of the day, human connection.

00:01:12.660 --> 00:01:18.800
Happy birthday dear grandma,

00:01:18.800 --> 00:01:22.600
cumpleanos feliz.

00:01:22.680 --> 00:01:26.620
It's a balance of being realistic and also being able to smile.

00:01:29.720 --> 00:01:30.900
Once upon a time...

00:01:34.340 --> 00:01:35.820
Thank you for coming.

00:01:35.830 --> 00:01:39.030
People cannot go to the gym, but it doesn't mean they can't get a workout.

00:01:39.030 --> 00:01:44.320
Casey Naftol and Matt Greene held their wedding online yesterday, complete with a flower girl.

00:01:44.320 --> 00:01:45.820
Mazel tov!

00:01:45.820 --> 00:01:49.980
People are really trying to be their best versions of themselves right now, I think that's all we can ask.

00:01:52.350 --> 00:01:54.100
So many families are missing milestones.

00:01:54.100 --> 00:01:58.850
But with a little improvising, they got to
meet their newborn great grandson.

00:01:58.850 --> 00:02:00.930
What a beautiful baby.

00:02:00.930 --> 00:02:06.000
A strict no visitation policy at this retirement home hasn't stopped Charlie Johnson from seeing

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:09.420
his 88-year-old father, albeit through a window.

00:02:09.420 --> 00:02:12.129
Amid the coronavirus outbreak many people are in need.

00:02:12.129 --> 00:02:14.680
And volunteers are stepping in to assist the elderly.

00:02:14.680 --> 00:02:18.760
We just decided to post a note, and put it
where we sometimes run into our neighbors.

00:02:18.760 --> 00:02:22.840
So that they feel and know that their neighbors have their back right now.

00:02:22.840 --> 00:02:26.010
Grocery delivery, pharmaceutical deliveries, whatever it is that they need from outside

00:02:26.010 --> 00:02:27.120
if they don't want to go out.

00:02:27.120 --> 00:02:30.469
Our thought was kind of like, okay, we can
shoulder some of the responsibility in our

00:02:30.469 --> 00:02:32.269
own individual communities.

00:02:32.269 --> 00:02:36.389
We have never been so close, you know.

00:02:36.389 --> 00:02:39.159
Because we a team now.

00:02:39.159 --> 00:02:41.919
Musicians have set up washing stations to protect the homeless.

00:02:41.919 --> 00:02:46.849
Melbourne's Sikh community rallying to prepare meals for delivery to anyone most in need.

00:02:46.849 --> 00:02:50.810
A Cuban medical brigade is on the way to Europe.

00:02:50.810 --> 00:02:58.629
The people who are now working hard, they're maybe not the people who get the most applause

00:02:58.629 --> 00:03:00.239
in everyday life.

00:03:00.239 --> 00:03:01.749
We just take them for granted.

00:03:01.749 --> 00:03:04.040
So now people are just applauding them.

00:03:12.020 --> 00:03:17.720
I hope that when this all passes, that we all still have the same amount of love and

00:03:17.720 --> 00:03:19.660
respect for each other that we have at this time.

00:03:25.510 --> 00:03:31.640
We're showing that we, we are bound together, even though we have to stay apart.

